0.523	selftest	node tools/check_lattice_kernel.mjs --self-test 	the flora walk's parity gate refuses a kernel one ulp, one slot or one row off
0.097	step	node tools/check_device_profile.mjs 	The device profile chooses per device, and a stored choice still wins (T-2559)
0.242	step	node tools/test_crash_guard.mjs 	Crash-aware boot: a dead session steps down once, a lost context reloads at most once (T-2547)
2.914	step	node tools/test_pacing_read.mjs 	Read frame pacing is offered only on the dev preview or with ?pacing=read, and reads sd and p95 as measure_walk_frames --live does (T-2732)
0.700	step	node tools/test_work_activity.mjs 	The actual 1812 portable rig meets its generated visible work tool and contact markers (T-3551)
0.086	step	node tools/test_nav_story.mjs 	Inspect's Story runs from design to today with BUILT, YOU ARE HERE and TODAY, another era's content filtered out and later facts marked after your visit (T-2643)
0.292	step	node tools/check_block_grow.mjs 	Watch a block grow shows each year only the buildings recorded standing by then, never guesses an undated one, and Leave restores the town exactly (T-3676)
0.076	step	node tools/test_move_comfort.mjs 	Move's Comfort holds the head bob, the eye height at its researched default with its Why, and snap-turn on touch (T-2653)
11.996	selftest	node tools/prebuild_layers.mjs --self-test 	Frontage built in Node is byte-identical build to build, and a prebuild from changed inputs is refused (T-2676)
0.439	step	node tools/test_house_errands.mjs 	John J. Glessner on his front walk is greeted, and goes home up his steps, through his door and in (T-3443)
27.214	step	node tools/check_jaunt_views.mjs 	Every 1904 jaunt stop stands clear of parkway trunks and lamp posts, with a view of its house (T-3263)
20.638	step	python3 tools/test_human_gentleman_1904.py 	A 1904 gentleman's day dress is sourced, layered and skinned on the shared rig (T-3441)
0.231	step	python3 tools/test_standing_horse_eye_uv_boundary.py 	Horse eye-UV derivative preserves original geometry, rig, clip, materials and image bytes (T-3086)
3.329	step	python3 tools/test_human_grounded_gait.py 	Resident mechanical gait holds prepared-source contact without stretching joints
0.115	step	node tools/lay_driven_wagons_1812.mjs --check 	The 1812 fort wagons' rows are what their layer writes: roads, stops and hours (T-3497)
0.672	step	node tools/test_human_duties.mjs 	The 1812 garrison is at its duties: knots that talk, break up and come back together, sentries walking their posts, a rank before its sergeant, nobody standing loose on the parade, deterministic (T-3490)
5.679	step	python3 tools/test_human_errand_1904.py 	A 1904 parlor maid's street dress and basket (Christine Nelson) are sourced and skinned, her loop on the block's walks (T-3481)
1.090	step	python3 tools/town_people_1871.py --check 	The 1871 city's people, their households, cards, days, dress and looks are what town_people_1871.py writes, bounded by the 1870 census (T-3690)
0.197	step	node tools/test_fabric.mjs 	A driver's plain garments read as cloth: weave, heather and sheen by shader patch, no texture, one program (T-2804)
1.645	step	node tools/test_photo_face_deployment.mjs 	Default photo faces cover every year and child proportions survive the shared photographic style (T-3767, T-3768)
2.118	step	node tools/test_board_climb.mjs 	Climb up and get down are drawn: the year's figure walks over, climbs by the hub and the rail and sits, its holds on the real vehicles, both sides, the eye watching (T-3560)
0.018	step	bash tools/check-merge-drivers.sh 	the merge drivers this clone needs are registered (T-1548)
0.435	step	bash tools/tickets.sh 	the tickets are here (kevinrhaas/chicago-tickets, cloned at tickets/)
